= Relations with Hindenburg

Our relationship with President Hindenburg can be described as wary as best, due to our diametrically opposed ideals. However, if we are to make any solid reforms, or even hold any chance of sustained government, we will need to at least have dealings with Hindenburg.

- @hindenburg_funds: Arrange some meetings with the King.
- @hindenburg_z: Utilise our influence with the [+ ldr_name +] to sway the King.
- @hindenburg_dvp: Utilise our influence with the [+ ul_name +] to sway the King.
- @return: Let's not do this for now.
- @easy_discard

